const support_namespaceObject = /*#__PURE__*/JSON.parse('{"title":"Frequently Asked Questions","faq1Question":"How do I enable Wizybot on my website?","faq1Answer":"To make Wizybot visible in your store, follow these steps in your Shopify admin:\\n\\n- In the left menu, select Online Store.\\n- Open the Themes submenu.\\n- Click Customize.\\n- In the left sidebar, select the App embeds icon.\\n- Find Wizybot and turn the switch on.\\n- Important: Click Save in the top-right corner.","faq2Question":"How do I connect WhatsApp, Instagram, or Facebook?","faq2Answer":"To integrate your Meta channels, you need to schedule a session with our technical team. You can reach us as follows:\\n\\n- Write directly in the WhatsApp group assigned to your store.\\n- If you do not have a group yet, contact us at: +57 350 256 6085.","faq3Question":"How do I correct a Wizybot reply?","faq3Answer":"If you want to adjust or improve the AI replies:\\n\\n- Go to the app main menu and select Knowledge.\\n- From there, you can add or edit the information the bot uses to respond.\\n- If you need more help, you can write through your WhatsApp support group. If you do not have a group yet, contact us at: +57 350 256 6085.","faq4Question":"Plans and pricing","faq4Answer":"We currently offer two options designed to scale with your business:\\n\\n- Basic plan ($69.99 USD/month): Includes up to 1,250 messages and 2,500 monthly comments.\\n- Custom plan: If your message volume is higher, we design a plan tailored to your operational needs.","faq5Question":"What do our plans include?","faq5Answer":"When you subscribe to Wizybot, you get full access to our tool ecosystem:\\n\\n- Advanced AI: Automatic replies to conversations and comments.\\n- Customer management (CRM): Full control of your prospects.\\n- Marketing: Bulk messaging and automations via WhatsApp.\\n- Unlimited team: Create as many users as you need, with specific roles and departments.\\n- VIP support: Priority guidance so your operation never stops.","noResults":"No FAQs match that criteria.","contactTitle":"Still have questions?","contactDescription":"Our support team is available to help you by email or WhatsApp with any technical or business question.","contactButton":"Contact Support"}');
